sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client (future caller)
  participant R as POST /v1/translate
  participant S as TranslationService
  participant K as Redis cache
  participant L as Anthropic API
  C->>R: text, targetLang, kind
  Note over R: Validate (up to 5,000 chars, 5 languages)
  R->>S: translate(text, lang, kind)
  Note over S: Sanitize text, then build cache key: tr: + SHA-256 of prompt version, model, language, text
  alt kind is lesson
    S->>K: GET key
    alt cache hit
      K-->>S: stored translation
      S-->>C: translation, cached true
    else cache miss
      Note over S: Identical concurrent requests share one in-flight call
      Note over S: protect(): swap code and formulas for numbered placeholders
      S->>L: system prompt + text to translate
      L-->>S: translated text
      Note over S: restore(): every placeholder back? If not, retry once, then 502
      S->>K: SET key with 30-day TTL
      S-->>C: translation, cached false
    end
  else kind is learner
    Note over S,K: Free-form learner text is never cached
    S->>L: same protect, call and restore steps
    S-->>C: translation, cached false
  end
